{"id":"642c63ec0f3c8567","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-accessibility.md","title":"Accessibility Relation","display":"df-accessibility — Accessibility Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-accessibility","aliases":["89-df-accessibility","accessibility relation","可及关系","可及性"],"display":"df-accessibility — Accessibility Relation","depends_on":["[[89-df-world]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-accessibility"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-accessibility</span><span>accessibility relation</span><span>可及关系</span><span>可及性</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-accessibility — Accessibility Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"edcd1eb132936613\" href=\"?note=edcd1eb132936613\" title=\"89-df-world\">89-df-world</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-accessibility-—-Accessibility-Relation-$R$\">df-accessibility — Accessibility Relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"edcd1eb132936613\" href=\"?note=edcd1eb132936613\" title=\"89-df-world\">89-df-world</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}accessibility}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AccRel}(W)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal P(W\\times W),\\\\\n\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{AccRel}(W)\\;\\forall w,v\\in W\\quad\n(wRv)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\langle w,v\\rangle\\in R.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}accessibility}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AccRel}(W)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal P(W\\times W),\\\\\n\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{AccRel}(W)\\;\\forall w,v\\in W\\quad\n(wRv)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\langle w,v\\rangle\\in R.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathrm{AccRel}(W)\">\\(R\\in\\mathrm{AccRel}(W)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 上的可及关系（即任意二元关系）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wRv\">\\(wRv\\)</span> : 从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 可及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>可及关系决定模态算子的语义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box \\varphi\">\\(\\Box \\varphi\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 真 ⟺ 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wRv\">\\(wRv\\)</span> 的世界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 真</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond \\varphi\">\\(\\Diamond \\varphi\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 真 ⟺ 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wRv\">\\(wRv\\)</span> 的世界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 真</li>\n</ul>\n<p>可及关系性质对应模态公理：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>框架性质</th>\n<th>对应公理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>自反 (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wRw\">\\(wRw\\)</span>)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p \\rightarrow p\">\\(\\Box p \\rightarrow p\\)</span> (T)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传递 (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wRv \\land vRu \\rightarrow wRu\">\\(wRv \\land vRu \\rightarrow wRu\\)</span>)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p \\rightarrow \\Box \\Box p\">\\(\\Box p \\rightarrow \\Box \\Box p\\)</span> (4)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对称 (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wRv \\rightarrow vRw\">\\(wRv \\rightarrow vRw\\)</span>)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p \\rightarrow \\Box \\Diamond p\">\\(p \\rightarrow \\Box \\Diamond p\\)</span> (B)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欧性 (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wRv \\land wRu \\rightarrow vRu\">\\(wRv \\land wRu \\rightarrow vRu\\)</span>)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond p \\rightarrow \\Box \\Diamond p\">\\(\\Diamond p \\rightarrow \\Box \\Diamond p\\)</span> (5)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逆良基 (无无限上升链)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box(\\Box p \\rightarrow p) \\rightarrow \\Box p\">\\(\\Box(\\Box p \\rightarrow p) \\rightarrow \\Box p\\)</span> (Löb)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>GL逻辑要求可及关系满足传递性和逆良基性 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a>)。</p>\n<p>相关概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a>：世界和可及关系构成框架</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5c02ba5095698c09\" href=\"?note=5c02ba5095698c09\" title=\"89-df-transitive-frame\">89-df-transitive-frame</a>：可及关系传递的框架</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2645a0212ae48293\" href=\"?note=2645a0212ae48293\" title=\"89-df-reflexive-frame\">89-df-reflexive-frame</a>：可及关系自反的框架</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ae4d761acfb9353d\" href=\"?note=ae4d761acfb9353d\" title=\"89-df-converse-well-founded\">89-df-converse-well-founded</a>：逆良基的可及关系</li>\n</ul>\n<p>参考文献：Boolos, George. <em>The Logic of Provability</em>. Chapter 2.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-accessibility-—-Accessibility-Relation-$R$","text":"df-accessibility — Accessibility Relation $R$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-world","status":"resolved","id":"edcd1eb132936613","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-world]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-world","status":"resolved","id":"edcd1eb132936613","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$W\\ne\\varnothing$ (see [[89-df-world]]).","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"GL逻辑要求可及关系满足传递性和逆良基性 (see [[89-df-gl-frame]])。","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c78d4bf1505bda5c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-frame]]：世界和可及关系构成框架","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-transitive-frame","status":"resolved","id":"5c02ba5095698c09","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-transitive-frame]]：可及关系传递的框架","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-reflexive-frame","status":"resolved","id":"2645a0212ae48293","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-reflexive-frame]]：可及关系自反的框架","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-converse-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"ae4d761acfb9353d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-converse-well-founded]]：逆良基的可及关系","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"W\\ne\\varnothing","di